# doctl billing-history

> Retrieve the billing history for a DigitalOcean account.
> More information: <https://docs.digitalocean.com/reference/doctl/reference/billing-history/>.

- Retrieve a paginated billing history:

`doctl billing-history list`

- Display help:

`doctl billing-history {{[-h|--help]}}`
